<h2>Questions from St. Albans</h2><div class="faq"><details><summary>Do you handle farm policies?</summary><div class="a"><p>Yes. Farm forms differ from homeowners policies, and we read them carefully before valuing a barn or equipment loss.</p></div></details><details><summary>Is ice damage to my dock covered?</summary><div class="a"><p>Many policies exclude or limit damage to docks and piers from ice. Check the property not covered and other structures sections.</p></div></details></div>
